# ignore files with no extention:
*
!*/
!*.*
!Makefile

# normal ignores:
*.exe
nimcache
*.pdb
*.ilk
*.out
.*

bin/*

# --- Copyright hygiene: never commit the game or its assets ---
# See AGENTS.md "Copyright hygiene" + docs/copywrite-notes.md.
# ROM images (the copyrighted work). Anywhere in the tree, not just bin/.
*.smc
*.sfc
# Captured audio ripped from the ROM (music/SFX are copyrighted assets).
*.wav
# Emulator savestates / memory dumps (partial copies of the ROM).
*.state
*.savestate
# Root-level image captures (screenshots contain game graphics). Scoped to the
# repo root so docs/ can still hold legit diagram images.
/*.png
/*.bmp
# Battery saves (player data, but keep them out of the repo anyway).
*.srm

# Auto-capture screenshots (play.nim F11) — contain game graphics.
bin/autoshots/
bin/sram_backups/
